FONT-ALIAS
==========

A git submodule (see docs/contrib.md), not a copy of the sources:

url    = https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xorg/font/alias.git
tag    = font-alias-1.0.6
commit = ebeee85f070dc12197ad98d1c849786f8e3be124
date   = 2026-02-07

Only misc/fonts.alias is used: tools/desktop/build-fonts.sh installs it in
/usr/local/share/fonts/misc.  The 75dpi, 100dpi and cyrillic aliases point
at fonts that are not built.  Nothing is written into the submodule.

